WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:36.400
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:36.670 --> 01:38.940
[The Lament of Autumn]

3
01:39.479 --> 01:41.789
[Episode 19]

4
01:52.920 --> 01:54.320
[Nanhuai Army Headquarters]

5
01:55.170 --> 01:56.390
[Nanhuai Army Headquarters]

6
02:00.280 --> 02:03.320
[Nanhuai Army Headquarters]

7
02:12.210 --> 02:13.020
Hold on.

8
02:15.410 --> 02:16.340
Why are you here?

9
02:23.970 --> 02:25.300
For Fifth Young Master?

10
03:01.410 --> 03:02.470
Ruitong, go find out

11
03:02.470 --> 03:04.330
who let in irrelevant personnel.

12
03:06.930 --> 03:07.740
Mr. Yu.

13
03:08.970 --> 03:09.840
May I have

14
03:09.840 --> 03:11.170
one minute of your time?

15
03:18.870 --> 03:20.470
Have you forgotten, Miss Ye?

16
03:20.740 --> 03:21.870
I made it very clear

17
03:22.680 --> 03:23.310
that we had

18
03:23.310 --> 03:25.110
better not see each other again.

19
03:28.370 --> 03:29.900
You saved my mother's life.

20
03:30.579 --> 03:31.710
For what it is worth,

21
03:31.810 --> 03:32.620
I should thank you

22
03:32.620 --> 03:33.710
in person.

23
03:33.930 --> 03:34.860
Back then, I really

24
03:34.860 --> 03:35.780
didn't know it was you.

25
03:35.780 --> 03:36.500
To me, it was

26
03:36.500 --> 03:37.520
a trivial matter.

27
03:38.430 --> 03:40.230
You don't need to keep it in mind.

28
03:51.030 --> 03:51.840
Sorry.

29
03:52.670 --> 03:54.020
I shouldn't have bothered you.

30
03:54.020 --> 03:55.220
No need to apologize.

31
03:55.930 --> 03:57.660
Just remember that from now on,

32
03:58.740 --> 04:00.800
we have nothing to do with each other.

33
05:02.150 --> 05:08.360
[Mahavira Hall]

34
05:27.570 --> 05:29.590
[Prayer]

35
05:37.830 --> 05:41.620
Thank you, Bodhisattva, for letting him return safely from the battlefield.

36
05:41.620 --> 05:42.670
Otherwise,

37
05:43.120 --> 05:44.480
I wouldn't have had a chance

38
05:44.480 --> 05:45.740
to thank him in person.

39
05:46.270 --> 05:48.480
I came specially to give thanks for my answered prayers.

40
05:48.480 --> 05:51.610
May he and I both be well on our separate paths from now on.

41
05:52.190 --> 05:53.920
May all his endeavors prosper.

42
06:06.990 --> 06:14.110
[Prayer]

43
06:14.210 --> 06:19.330
[Guanyin Pavilion]

44
06:23.930 --> 06:26.780
[Opera House]

45
06:29.860 --> 06:31.390
-Bravo! -Good!

46
06:31.390 --> 06:32.960
Well done!

47
06:33.680 --> 06:34.870
Thank you, everyone.

48
06:34.870 --> 06:36.070
-Thank you. -Thanks.

49
06:48.570 --> 06:49.770
I have to go home now

50
06:49.870 --> 06:51.270
for some family matters.

51
06:51.330 --> 06:53.130
No problem. Leave the rest to us.

52
06:53.540 --> 06:54.430
Thank you all.

53
06:54.690 --> 06:55.220
Goodbye.

54
07:34.100 --> 07:36.030
How did it suddenly start raining?

55
07:38.300 --> 07:40.760
It started raining out of the blue. How come?

56
07:45.550 --> 07:46.810
I'll take an umbrella.

57
08:01.800 --> 08:03.930
Sir, would you like to buy an umbrella?

58
08:07.070 --> 08:08.810
Sir, this is too much,

59
08:08.830 --> 08:10.630
way more than an umbrella costs.

60
08:14.010 --> 08:14.720
Give the umbrella

61
08:14.720 --> 08:16.040
to that girl in white.

62
08:16.940 --> 08:17.600
Got it.

63
08:24.980 --> 08:26.190
Miss, this is for you.

64
08:27.010 --> 08:28.610
Who asked you to give me this?

65
08:59.770 --> 09:00.850
The Japanese brutally

66
09:00.850 --> 09:00.910
[Blood may be shed, but we swear to safeguard our land and nation]

67
09:00.910 --> 09:03.030
slaughtered our students and merchants in Changsha.

68
09:03.030 --> 09:04.030
All 400 million

69
09:04.030 --> 09:05.290
compatriots must unite

70
09:05.290 --> 09:07.460
and pool our wisdom together to avenge the blood

71
09:07.460 --> 09:08.750
of our fallen students and merchants.

72
09:08.750 --> 09:11.550
We must also show that we Chinese have not given in!

73
09:11.630 --> 09:12.510
Boycott Japanese goods!

74
09:12.510 --> 09:12.610
Boycott Japanese goods!

75
09:12.610 --> 09:14.130
[Blood may be shed, but we swear to safeguard our land and nation]

76
09:14.130 --> 09:16.030
Hold our ground to the end!

77
09:16.510 --> 09:16.750
[No selling of Japanese goods; Hold our ground to the end]

78
09:16.750 --> 09:17.990
Boycott Japanese goods!

79
