[No selling of Japanese goods; Hold our ground to the end]

89
09:26.130 --> 09:28.750
Down with Japanese imperialism!

90
09:29.720 --> 09:31.750
Cancel the Twenty-One Demands!

91
09:32.030 --> 09:34.410
Down with Japanese imperialism!

92
09:34.980 --> 09:38.840
Boycott Japanese goods! Hold our ground to the end!

93
09:38.840 --> 09:38.960
Down with Japanese imperialism!

94
09:38.960 --> 09:41.080
[Cancel the Twenty-One Demands]

95
09:41.080 --> 09:41.210
Cancel the Twenty-One Demands!

96
09:41.210 --> 09:43.330
[No selling of Japanese goods; Hold our ground to the end]

97
09:43.330 --> 09:44.860
Down with Japanese imperialism!

98
09:44.860 --> 09:45.890
Who is in charge

99
09:45.890 --> 09:47.290
of the inspection office?

100
09:47.290 --> 09:48.240
I request the immediate return

101
09:48.240 --> 09:49.150
of the two boxes of cloth

102
09:49.150 --> 09:50.650
confiscated from my fabric store.

103
09:50.650 --> 09:51.500
We carried out our duties

104
09:51.500 --> 09:52.340
as per the rules of

105
09:52.340 --> 09:53.460
the National Salvation Association.

106
09:53.460 --> 09:54.850
For a long time, both the Japanese government

107
09:54.850 --> 09:56.770
and the Japanese people have regarded China

108
09:56.770 --> 09:57.810
as theirs for the taking.

109
09:57.810 --> 09:59.800
In 1915, foreign foes eyed China with predatory intent.

110
09:59.800 --> 10:01.840
Countless citizens were stricken with grief and indignation.

111
10:01.840 --> 10:02.700
Yet recrimination and self-pity

112
10:02.700 --> 10:03.550
will serve no purpose.

113
10:03.550 --> 10:04.150
That's right!

114
10:04.150 --> 10:05.360
Bravo!

115
10:05.630 --> 10:06.480
Great performance!

116
10:06.480 --> 10:08.240
Bravo!

117
10:08.840 --> 10:10.000
Well said!

118
10:10.000 --> 10:11.750
-Bravo! -Well done!

119
10:14.250 --> 10:15.410
Patriotism

120
10:15.410 --> 10:16.860
requires actual action.

121
10:16.940 --> 10:18.290
Boycott all Japanese goods!

122
10:18.290 --> 10:19.390
Boycott Japanese goods!

123
10:19.390 --> 10:20.530
Boycott Japanese goods!

124
10:20.530 --> 10:21.620
Boycott Japanese goods!

125
10:21.620 --> 10:22.630
Boycott Japanese goods!

126
10:22.630 --> 10:23.700
Boycott Japanese goods!

127
10:23.700 --> 10:24.740
Boycott Japanese goods!

128
10:24.740 --> 10:25.740
Boycott Japanese goods!

129
10:25.740 --> 10:26.580
Boycott Japanese goods!

130
10:26.580 --> 10:27.600
Boycott Japanese goods!

131
10:27.600 --> 10:28.890
Boycott Japanese goods!

132
10:28.890 --> 10:29.910
Shut up!

133
10:30.010 --> 10:31.130
Did anyone allow you to put on a play here?

134
10:31.130 --> 10:31.860
Shut your mouths!

135
10:31.860 --> 10:33.250
How dare you insult the Empire of Japan!

136
10:33.250 --> 10:34.980
-Stop the acting! -They're Japanese! Beat them up!

137
10:34.980 --> 10:35.960
Shut your mouths!

138
10:35.960 --> 10:36.860
How dare you

139
10:36.940 --> 10:38.470
insult the Empire of Japan!

140
10:41.910 --> 10:42.740
Back off!

141
10:43.170 --> 10:44.300
All of you, back off!

142
10:56.320 --> 10:57.600
I'll beat you to death!

143
10:58.240 --> 10:59.100
Come back here!

144
11:00.270 --> 11:01.850
Down with imperialism!

145
11:02.290 --> 11:04.150
Down with Japanese imperialism!

146
11:05.840 --> 11:06.690
Bear with it.

147
11:09.500 --> 11:10.510
Are you guys alright?

148
11:10.510 --> 11:11.480
Apply some safflower oil

149
11:11.480 --> 11:12.460
on the bruises.

150
11:12.790 --> 11:13.270
Come on.

151
11:13.620 --> 11:14.410
I'm fine.

152
11:14.620 --> 11:16.000
Just some minor injuries.

153
11:16.000 --> 11:17.030
It was so satisfying

154
11:17.030 --> 11:18.050
to give those Japanese

155
11:18.050 --> 11:19.100
a good beating.

156
11:19.200 --> 11:20.000
Careful.

157
11:20.860 --> 11:21.960
Pingjun, Caizhi,

158
11:22.010 --> 11:22.820
shall we still gather

159
11:22.820 --> 11:24.360
at Guangyi Street tomorrow?

160
11:24.360 --> 11:26.020
I've contacted the marchers.

161
11:26.050 --> 11:26.740
They will set off

162
11:26.740 --> 11:28.700
from Dongqu Street for tomorrow's march.

163
11:28.700 --> 11:29.250
To support

164
11:29.250 --> 11:30.510
each other, we'll give speeches

165
11:30.510 --> 11:31.500
at the intersection.

166
11:31.500 --> 11:32.230
Here you are,

167
11:32.320 --> 11:33.500
the speech draft for tomorrow.

168
11:33.500 --> 11:34.760
Please pass it around.

169
11:40.820 --> 11:41.750
What is this for?

170
11:43.440 --> 11:44.370
Are you alright?

171
11:44.580 --> 11:45.110
You good?

172
11:51.780 --> 11:53.810
[Japanese Chamber of Commerce]

173
11:56.940 --> 11:58.460
Today's anti-Japanese performance

174
11:58.460 --> 12:00.290
before the gate of the Japanese Chamber

175
12:00.290 --> 12:01.950
of Commerce was spectacular.

176
12:03.460 --> 12:04.390
Was it you

177
12:05.370 --> 12:06.500
who wrote this play?

178
12:08.100 --> 12:08.720
Yes.

179
12:10.870 --> 12:12.200
You enjoy quite a reputation in Nanhuai's

180
12:12.200 --> 12:13.530
literary and art circles.

181
12:13.530 --> 12:15.860
How could you do something so foolish as to

182
12:15.890 --> 12:17.670
incite disturbance and wreck the friendly ties

183
12:17.670 --> 12:18.890
between China and Japan?

184
12:18.890 --> 12:20.690
The Japanese have taken our land

185
12:20.700 --> 12:22.150
and slaughtered our people.

186
12:22.150 --> 12:22.940
What do you think that is,

187
12:22.940 --> 12:24.100
an act of friendship or banditry?

188
12:24.100 --> 12:24.860
This area

189
12:25.910 --> 12:27.510
is the Japanese concession.

190
12:28.120 --> 12:29.780
You wrote a play to start a riot

191
12:29.820 --> 12:31.500
and hurt Japanese expatriates.

192
12:31.500 --> 12:32.440
Are you aware

193
12:33.030 --> 12:34.230
that you're probably

194
12:34.530 --> 12:36.290
never able to walk out of here?

195
12:37.960 --> 12:38.750
That said,

196
12:39.460 --> 12:40.360
to express

197
12:40.360 --> 12:41.550
the goodwill of

198
12:41.550 --> 12:42.680
the Empire of Japan,

199
12:42.890 --> 12:45.160
as long as you apologize in public,

200
12:45.500 --> 12:47.550
we will let you go.

201
12:48.550 --> 12:49.750
Suppose a bandit

202
12:49.750 --> 12:51.080
breaks into your house,

203
12:51.370 --> 12:52.860
burns, kills and loots—

204
12:54.120 --> 12:56.720
do you see any necessity in apologizing to him?

205
13:03.830 --> 13:06.780
You still seem a bit out of it, Miss Ye.

206
13:07.120 --> 13:08.390
Every 10 minutes,

207
13:08.670 --> 13:10.550
splash ice cold water on Miss Ye.

208
13:12.270 --> 13:13.580
In such weather,

209
13:13.860 --> 13:16.260
this should sober her up to reality faster.

210
13:31.150 --> 13:32.610
That swapped batch of arms

211
13:32.650 --> 13:34.440
is available on the black market now.

212
13:34.440 --> 13:35.430
The source is the same as that of the pistol

213
13:35.430 --> 13:36.860
in the assassination case.

214
13:36.860 --> 13:38.530
But the arms dealer killed himself

215
13:38.530 --> 13:39.550
and left no clues.

216
13:42.410 --> 13:43.960
We used to mistake

217
13:44.200 --> 13:45.860
Liao Dongfeng, who we already

218
13:46.600 --> 13:48.800
dealt with, for the mole in the army.

219
13:49.820 --> 13:51.050
But now it seems

220
13:51.960 --> 13:53.890
the rat is not only still around us,

221
13:54.410 --> 13:55.220
but also

222
13:56.620 --> 13:57.830
a high-ranking officer

223
13:57.830 --> 13:59.960
with access to weapons and equipment.

224
14:01.220 --> 14:02.410
Are you suggesting

225
14:02.890 --> 14:04.490
an internal investigation?

226
14:07.290 --> 14:08.020
Your father,

227
14:09.030 --> 14:10.030
Zhang Xiaoxian,

228
14:11.000 --> 14:12.790
and army commanders of all levels,

229
14:12.790 --> 14:13.720
including heads

230
14:14.360 --> 14:15.890
of divisions and brigades—

231
14:16.050 --> 14:17.650
all must be properly vetted.

232
14:20.870 --> 14:21.440
Then...

233
14:22.940 --> 14:24.910
What about Brigade Commander Kuang?

234
14:24.910 --> 14:26.840
Everyone will be treated equally.

235
14:27.370 --> 14:27.740
Got it.

236
14:27.740 --> 14:28.320
Bad news!

237
14:28.870 --> 14:30.330
Listen, there's bad news.

238
14:30.510 --> 14:30.970
She...

239
14:34.240 --> 14:34.620
I...

240
14:34.940 --> 14:35.470
Speak up.

241
14:35.980 --> 14:36.410
You...

242
14:38.220 --> 14:39.050
That sweetheart of yours

243
14:39.050 --> 14:41.650
was taken by the Japanese Chamber of Commerce!

244
14:43.200 --> 14:44.360
Here's what happened.

245
14:44.360 --> 14:46.170
Chunfeng Troupe did a play about boycotting Japanese goods

246
14:46.170 --> 14:47.000
and injured some Japanese expats.

247
14:47.000 --> 14:48.750
So the Japanese took the opportunity to stir up

248
14:48.750 --> 14:51.810
trouble and ask the consulate to punish them severely.

249
14:53.560 --> 14:54.010
No, no.

250
14:54.320 --> 14:55.090
Hold on.

251
14:55.770 --> 14:56.700
I must remind you

252
14:56.820 --> 14:57.870
that the Japanese have

253
14:57.870 --> 14:58.910
administrative autonomy

254
14:58.910 --> 15:00.500
and extraterritoriality over that area.

255
15:00.500 --> 15:02.320
You must not go head-to-head with them.

256
15:02.320 --> 15:03.720
If this gets to Chu Wenfu,

257
15:04.790 --> 15:06.250
the matter will escalate.

258
15:12.410 --> 15:13.790
Liang Wenbo was called to the city hall for a talk.

259
15:13.790 --> 15:15.320
No idea when he will be back.

260
15:15.620 --> 15:16.720
We can't keep waiting.

261
15:16.720 --> 15:17.150
Yes.

262
15:17.370 --> 15:18.550
Those Japanese ruffians started the trouble

263
15:18.550 --> 15:19.340
and wielded swords first.

264
15:19.340 --> 15:21.600
What right did they have to take Pingjun?

265
15:21.820 --> 15:22.420
Come back!

266
15:22.770 --> 15:24.030
All of you, stop there!

267
15:26.480 --> 15:27.810
What are you going to do?

268
15:28.220 --> 15:29.410
Risk your lives and fight against

269
15:29.410 --> 15:30.530
the bullets of the Japanese Chamber of Commerce

270
15:30.530 --> 15:31.440
with a few wooden sticks?

271
15:31.440 --> 15:33.250
Not only will you fail to rescue Pingjun,

272
15:33.250 --> 15:34.780
but also make things worse.

273
15:35.960 --> 15:36.760
Put them down.

274
15:37.770 --> 15:39.690
Put down your sticks right now!

275
15:40.030 --> 15:41.030
Put them all down!

276
15:41.120 --> 15:41.650
Xueting!

277
15:42.600 --> 15:44.010
You're being hot-headed now.

278
15:44.010 --> 15:45.510
The more critical the moment is,

279
15:45.510 --> 15:47.570
the more you need to keep a clear head.

280
15:48.750 --> 15:49.580
Going to the chamber now

281
15:49.580 --> 15:51.620
is equal to killing yourself for nothing!

282
15:51.620 --> 15:52.620
Pingjun could forsake her life

283
15:52.620 --> 15:53.460
for the anti-Japanese movement.

284
15:53.460 --> 15:54.720
Why can't I do the same?

285
15:55.010 --> 15:55.910
She is my fiancée.

286
15:55.910 --> 15:56.550
If she dies,

287
15:56.550 --> 15:58.210
what's the point of me living?

288
15:59.320 --> 16:00.790
[Xing Newspaper Office]

289
16:00.790 --> 16:02.510
Major incident! Major incident!

290
16:02.510 --> 16:03.310
What's wrong?

291
16:03.500 --> 16:04.700
Anything happened to Pingjun?

292
16:04.700 --> 16:05.770
Soldiers of the Yu family have surrounded

293
16:05.770 --> 16:08.570
the entrance to the Japanese Chamber of Commerce.

294
16:12.970 --> 16:15.980
[Japanese Chamber of Commerce]

295
16:23.150 --> 16:23.980
May I ask

296
16:24.050 --> 16:25.980
what your soldiers are doing here?

297
16:26.600 --> 16:28.490
Are you declaring war on us and opening fire?

298
16:28.490 --> 16:29.580
[Dexing Tea Store] [Retail and wholesale of all kinds of tea]

299
16:29.580 --> 16:30.510
No, none of that.

300
16:31.680 --> 16:33.870
We're conducting training under orders.

301
16:33.870 --> 16:35.730
This is the Japanese concession.

302
16:37.960 --> 16:39.410
This is Nanhuai City!

303
16:39.740 --> 16:40.790
The Yu family rules!

304
16:40.790 --> 16:43.750
[Japanese Chamber of Commerce]

305
16:43.750 --> 16:46.130
7th Platoon, 3rd Company, 2nd Regiment, Ninth Army.

306
16:46.130 --> 16:46.940
Get ready!

307
16:49.650 --> 16:50.340
Shoot!

308
16:50.340 --> 16:50.950
[Dexing Tea Store] [Retail and wholesale of all kinds of tea]

309
17:07.180 --> 17:09.069
How on earth did Deputy Commander Yu

310
17:09.069 --> 17:11.440
get involved in this?

311
17:14.270 --> 17:15.300
Our findings show

312
17:15.589 --> 17:16.700
that Ye Pingjun

313
17:16.920 --> 17:19.180
seems to be Deputy Commander Yu's woman.

314
17:21.740 --> 17:23.069
What took you so long

315
17:23.069 --> 17:24.420
to find out about that?

316
17:25.109 --> 17:25.849
Previously,

317
17:26.220 --> 17:28.380
she was with Fifth Young Master for a while.

318
17:28.380 --> 17:29.980
Then they broke up.

319
17:37.560 --> 17:40.340
If we release that girl now

320
17:40.900 --> 17:42.850
due to pressure,

321
17:43.370 --> 17:46.030
we won't be able to explain to our citizens here.

322
17:46.980 --> 17:51.230
It'll also bring shame to the empire.

323
17:51.720 --> 17:52.210
Yes!

324
17:54.410 --> 17:55.550
But if we don't release her,

325
17:55.550 --> 17:58.140
the chamber will turn into a shooting range

326
17:58.620 --> 18:00.600
for the Yu Army.

327
18:15.180 --> 18:16.310
Fifth Young Master.

328
18:19.150 --> 18:20.020
It's done.

329
18:20.280 --> 18:21.660
President Takahashi of the Japanese Chamber of Commerce

330
18:21.660 --> 18:22.900
agreed to release Miss Ye.

331
18:22.900 --> 18:23.480
But they

332
18:23.570 --> 18:25.160
asked you to do them the honor

333
18:25.160 --> 18:26.850
of having a meal with them afterwards,

334
18:26.850 --> 18:27.790
saying that they'd like to talk

335
18:27.790 --> 18:29.450
about some business with you.

336
19:26.010 --> 19:27.160
Yu Changxuan.

337
19:30.400 --> 19:31.930
You're here.

338
19:42.590 --> 19:43.300
Yes, I am.

339
19:45.800 --> 19:46.910
You're fine now.

340
20:16.050 --> 20:16.850
How did it go?

341
20:17.420 --> 20:18.480
Is Miss Ye alright?

342
20:43.120 --> 20:44.570
Deputy Commander Yu!

343
21:32.540 --> 21:33.790
Go on with the training.

344
21:33.790 --> 21:34.420
Yes!

345
21:40.480 --> 21:42.160
Go on with the training!

346
21:42.190 --> 21:43.190
Yes!

347
21:49.250 --> 21:54.750
[Japanese Chamber of Commerce]

348
21:54.860 --> 21:56.370
[Newspaper Stand]

349
21:57.580 --> 21:59.690
[Newspaper Stand]

350
22:01.910 --> 22:02.800
Anyway, it's a good thing

351
22:02.800 --> 22:04.060
that she's been saved.

352
22:27.930 --> 22:28.730
Drive slower.

353
22:29.460 --> 22:29.980
Yes.

354
22:37.070 --> 22:38.000
Ye Pingjun,

355
22:39.240 --> 22:40.160
why did you show up

356
22:40.160 --> 22:41.250
in my world again?

357
22:57.350 --> 22:58.920
Yu Changxuan is so lucky.

358
22:59.180 --> 23:00.710
In the battle of Luanjiang,

359
23:00.720 --> 23:02.250
his weapons were switched,

360
23:04.380 --> 23:06.350
yet he still managed to escape death.

361
23:06.350 --> 23:08.100
Not only that.

362
23:10.110 --> 23:12.370
Thanks to it, he became famous overnight

363
23:12.500 --> 23:13.810
and rose rapidly.

364
23:14.510 --> 23:16.480
But he doesn't have a solid base yet,

365
23:16.480 --> 23:18.110
since he has just assumed power.

366
23:18.110 --> 23:20.720
He already knows there's a mole in the army, and is now

367
23:20.720 --> 23:22.380
conducting a thorough investigation.

368
23:22.380 --> 23:23.660
All senior officers,

369
23:24.360 --> 23:26.480
even including me, his brother-in-law,

370
23:26.480 --> 23:28.010
are subjected to scrutiny.

371
23:28.350 --> 23:29.410
During these days,

372
23:30.850 --> 23:32.850
we'd better not contact each other.

373
23:34.350 --> 23:34.810
I won't

374
23:34.810 --> 23:36.680
take any action either.

375
23:37.050 --> 23:37.510
Agreed.

376
23:38.720 --> 23:40.030
Let's do as you say.

377
23:42.550 --> 23:44.520
As long as you get to stay by his side,

378
23:44.520 --> 23:46.580
you'll find an opportunity someday.

379
23:48.960 --> 23:51.440
After all, guarding against internal enemies is not

380
23:51.440 --> 23:53.900
so easy as defending against external ones.

381
24:18.900 --> 24:20.310
Why did you get up?

382
24:27.960 --> 24:29.250
I made ginger soup.

383
24:29.480 --> 24:30.810
Drink it while it's hot.

384
24:32.050 --> 24:32.850
Sure.

385
24:36.310 --> 24:38.180
What exactly happened?

386
24:39.660 --> 24:41.350
Last night, Mr. Yu had you

387
24:41.380 --> 24:42.460
brought home.

388
24:42.920 --> 24:45.320
They wouldn't say anything except that you

389
24:45.510 --> 24:47.920
got caught in the rain while doing a play.

390
24:50.810 --> 24:52.010
I'm fine.

391
24:52.610 --> 24:54.210
I just had a little accident.

392
25:05.110 --> 25:05.920
Mom,

393
25:06.850 --> 25:08.000
I'm sorry

394
25:08.590 --> 25:10.010
for making you worry.

395
25:16.010 --> 25:16.850
Pingjun,

396
25:18.000 --> 25:19.010
I know

397
25:19.850 --> 25:21.200
that very incident

398
25:21.520 --> 25:23.070
has always been a barrier

399
25:23.100 --> 25:25.180
between you and Xueting.

400
25:25.390 --> 25:27.030
I see it all,

401
25:27.380 --> 25:28.780
and it worries me deeply.

402
25:29.090 --> 25:30.700
But I have no idea

403
25:31.250 --> 25:33.600
as to how to help you resolve the problem.

404
25:34.920 --> 25:35.720
Mom,

405
25:37.200 --> 25:40.660
Xueting and I grew up together.

406
25:41.450 --> 25:43.450
Both his scholarship and character

407
25:43.610 --> 25:45.000
are impeccable.

408
25:45.510 --> 25:47.390
When I was little, I thought

409
25:47.740 --> 25:49.120
that the two of us

410
25:49.310 --> 25:50.070
would definitely

411
25:50.070 --> 25:51.720
end up being a couple.

412
25:53.110 --> 25:54.920
But now I have finally realized

413
25:55.660 --> 25:57.770
that perhaps because we were parted

414
25:57.900 --> 25:59.850
for too long,

415
26:01.750 --> 26:02.850
we are no longer

416
26:02.850 --> 26:04.250
who we used to be.

417
26:05.400 --> 26:06.770
It seems many things

418
26:07.940 --> 26:10.000
can never go back to the way they were.

419
26:11.900 --> 26:12.740
Pingjun.

420
26:16.500 --> 26:18.330
Mr. Yu did do wrong in some things

421
26:19.960 --> 26:21.050
before.

422
26:22.220 --> 26:24.050
But I can tell

423
26:25.420 --> 26:26.290
that he

424
26:27.070 --> 26:28.480
genuinely loves you.

425
26:30.290 --> 26:33.020
I'm just trying to say that you don't love someone

426
26:33.290 --> 26:35.550
because you're used to him being around.

427
26:37.310 --> 26:39.200
Nobody can force you

428
26:39.590 --> 26:41.900
to choose anyone.

429
26:44.370 --> 26:46.160
All I want you to know

430
26:48.030 --> 26:50.660
is that you should just follow your heart.

431
27:09.570 --> 27:11.370
When it comes to picking a house,

432
27:11.400 --> 27:12.460
my uncle's dicernment

433
27:12.460 --> 27:14.060
is certainly second to none.

434
27:14.770 --> 27:15.830
This Western-style house

435
27:15.830 --> 27:16.830
is a masterpiece

436
27:16.830 --> 27:18.310
of a famous French designer.

437
27:18.310 --> 27:19.920
My uncle bought it specifically for us

438
27:19.920 --> 27:21.160
as a wedding gift.

439
27:22.400 --> 27:23.880
The sunroom outside the main building

440
27:23.880 --> 27:25.550
even has hot spring water piped in.

441
27:25.550 --> 27:28.150
So the flowers in it would bloom all year round.

442
27:28.440 --> 27:30.460
The annex comes with a dedicated banquet hall.

443
27:30.460 --> 27:31.350
I've seen it.

444
27:31.590 --> 27:32.510
It's rather spacious,

445
27:32.510 --> 27:33.090
enough

446
27:33.090 --> 27:34.550
to serve as a dance hall.

447
27:34.700 --> 27:36.310
It will come in very handy when we invite

448
27:36.310 --> 27:37.320
friends over.

449
27:37.700 --> 27:39.810
Besides, I specifically requested

450
27:39.940 --> 27:41.050
that your study

451
27:41.090 --> 27:42.820
be decorated in Chinese style.

452
27:42.920 --> 27:46.250
In that room, you can feast your eyes on the beautiful scenery

453
27:46.250 --> 27:48.380
of the garden when you open the window.

454
27:49.090 --> 27:51.490
Now, let me show you around the back garden.

455
27:52.500 --> 27:53.290
Ziyi.

456
28:01.380 --> 28:02.180
I'm sorry.

457
28:06.140 --> 28:07.900
Why are you apologizing to me?

458
28:08.240 --> 28:09.740
Did you get yourself

459
28:09.880 --> 28:10.660
a mistress

460
28:10.660 --> 28:11.990
when you fought the war?

461
28:13.110 --> 28:14.910
I'm cancelling our engagement.

462
28:22.290 --> 28:23.350
Little did I expect

463
28:24.880 --> 28:27.080
this little visit to the house together

464
28:27.140 --> 28:28.950
to be a brief last rally

465
28:29.050 --> 28:30.570
before our engagement

466
28:30.570 --> 28:32.050
came to an end.

467
28:33.570 --> 28:36.290
Couldn't you at least wait till the visit was over?

468
28:36.290 --> 28:37.980
You don't even have the heart to spare me

469
28:37.980 --> 28:39.440
a little patience, do you?

470
28:41.010 --> 28:42.610
I just don't want to lie to you

471
28:43.400 --> 28:45.060
or deceive myself any longer.

472
28:45.920 --> 28:47.250
During the entire time,

473
28:47.400 --> 28:48.600
for the sake of power,

474
28:49.350 --> 28:50.950
I've always been in disguise

475
28:51.090 --> 28:52.420
and deceived everyone,

476
28:55.220 --> 28:56.350
including my family

477
28:57.270 --> 28:58.160
and myself.

478
29:00.220 --> 29:01.400
Before my rivals,

479
29:02.440 --> 29:04.300
I pretend to indulge in pleasure.

480
29:06.000 --> 29:07.200
Before my family,

481
29:08.940 --> 29:10.540
I act like an arrogant rebel.

482
29:11.250 --> 29:12.420
Before women,

483
29:13.180 --> 29:14.910
I feign an affectionate lover.

484
29:16.110 --> 29:18.110
It seems everything can be put to use

485
29:18.590 --> 29:19.290
for me, and

486
29:20.010 --> 29:21.940
everything can be discarded by me.

487
29:23.900 --> 29:25.090
Marriage and love

488
29:27.110 --> 29:28.200
are no exceptions.

489
29:30.810 --> 29:31.460
So,

490
29:33.270 --> 29:34.200
during the entire time,

491
29:34.200 --> 29:35.660
you've been faking

492
29:37.090 --> 29:38.620
your intention to marry me,

493
29:39.900 --> 29:42.100
and it's only a trade-off of interests,

494
29:42.680 --> 29:43.480
right?

495
29:46.160 --> 29:46.660
Right.

496
29:50.960 --> 29:52.890
Then you've been acting very well.

497
29:53.000 --> 29:54.160
Flawless.

498
29:54.610 --> 29:55.960
Impeccable.

499
29:56.810 --> 29:57.550
You could have

500
29:57.550 --> 29:58.750
kept acting like that

501
29:59.110 --> 30:00.220
until you gained the prestige

502
30:00.220 --> 30:01.550
and fame you longed for,

503
30:02.590 --> 30:04.720
and finally satisfied your ambition.

504
30:05.680 --> 30:06.440
But why do you have to

505
30:06.440 --> 30:07.700
suddenly stop acting?

506
30:10.770 --> 30:12.500
This time, on the battlefield,

507
30:12.810 --> 30:14.720
as I faced the real threat of death,

508
30:14.720 --> 30:15.780
I finally realized

509
30:16.640 --> 30:18.700
that I hated to live the rest of my life

510
30:18.850 --> 30:19.510
in disguise.

511
30:19.510 --> 30:20.740
Don't you give me these

512
30:20.740 --> 30:22.140
high-sounding excuses!

513
30:26.010 --> 30:26.870
The real reason

514
30:26.880 --> 30:28.480
lies in that accident you had

515
30:29.200 --> 30:30.920
and the fact that you fell in love

516
30:30.920 --> 30:32.520
with Ye Pingjun, doesn't it?

517
30:40.980 --> 30:41.770
Yes.

518
30:43.960 --> 30:45.490
I'm indeed in love with her.

519
30:47.350 --> 30:49.010
On the verge of life and death,

520
30:50.090 --> 30:51.200
I was thinking

521
30:53.090 --> 30:54.510
that I had never ever,

522
30:55.500 --> 30:56.420
not even once,

523
30:57.480 --> 30:58.740
expressed my feelings

524
30:59.200 --> 31:00.750
to the girl I love.

525
31:07.000 --> 31:07.460
Ziyi,

526
31:08.900 --> 31:09.830
when one has been

527
31:11.070 --> 31:11.930
to some places,

528
31:12.240 --> 31:13.440
like the battlefield

529
31:14.420 --> 31:15.680
and one's inner heart,

530
31:16.590 --> 31:17.320
one can never

531
31:18.570 --> 31:20.170
go back to what one used to be.

532
31:26.050 --> 31:27.850
The Yu Army has to get its funding

533
31:27.940 --> 31:29.510
from somewhere.

534
31:30.660 --> 31:32.720
The financial aid from the Tao family

535
31:32.960 --> 31:35.620
is a necessary condition for your rise to power.

536
31:37.570 --> 31:39.030
For the sake of Ye Pingjun,

537
31:40.010 --> 31:42.050
you would rather go against reason,

538
31:43.310 --> 31:44.910
jeopardize your own future,

539
31:45.010 --> 31:46.610
and make enemies everywhere

540
31:46.790 --> 31:48.190
regardless of any costs,

541
31:49.250 --> 31:50.050
right?

542
31:52.420 --> 31:53.750
Since I brought this up,

543
31:54.550 --> 31:55.680
I've surely thought

544
31:56.850 --> 31:58.450
about all the consequences.

545
32:04.350 --> 32:05.610
I sincerely apologize

546
32:06.400 --> 32:09.200
to you for this matter— from the bottom of my heart.

547
32:09.400 --> 32:10.530
But of course, I know

548
32:12.510 --> 32:14.040
that no amount of apologies

549
32:15.510 --> 32:16.700
will be enough.

550
32:19.160 --> 32:20.620
When Uncle Tao comes back,

551
32:21.310 --> 32:23.640
I will pay a visit and apologize in person.

552
32:32.350 --> 32:33.490
Yu Changxuan,

553
32:35.010 --> 32:37.250
I can tell you this for sure:

554
32:38.700 --> 32:40.140
I don't care

555
32:40.810 --> 32:41.850
if you lie to me

556
32:42.680 --> 32:44.510
or use me.

557
32:45.310 --> 32:47.040
Our relationship is only about

558
32:48.160 --> 32:50.090
taking what we need respectively.

559
32:50.610 --> 32:52.560
You want the Tao family's support,

560
32:52.580 --> 32:53.220
while I want

561
32:53.220 --> 32:55.270
the title of Yu Changxuan's wife.

562
32:58.090 --> 32:59.110
I'll concede.

563
33:01.050 --> 33:03.250
I agree to let you keep her as a mistress.

564
33:03.420 --> 33:05.280
Even if you want to give her a title

565
33:05.640 --> 33:07.240
by taking her as a concubine,

566
33:07.920 --> 33:08.820
I'll say yes.

567
33:10.840 --> 33:12.250
I don't want to do any of that.

568
33:12.250 --> 33:12.880
Then are you going

569
33:12.880 --> 33:14.810
to marry her in the open with honor?

570
33:17.510 --> 33:18.750
Come to your senses.

571
33:19.470 --> 33:21.000
She doesn't love you at all.

572
33:22.000 --> 33:23.530
Whether she loves me or not,

573
33:24.400 --> 33:25.670
all that matters is that I know I love her.

574
33:25.670 --> 33:26.380
But she is

575
33:26.380 --> 33:28.310
getting married to Jiang Xueting!

576
33:28.400 --> 33:30.400
Even if she's marrying another man,

577
33:30.940 --> 33:32.800
I won't marry someone I don't love

578
33:33.590 --> 33:34.850
against my own wishes,

579
33:35.550 --> 33:37.090
or lie to you and myself

580
33:38.110 --> 33:39.030
with a marriage

581
33:40.410 --> 33:41.470
of convenience.

582
33:53.720 --> 33:54.660
Yu Changxuan.

583
33:56.630 --> 33:57.880
Do you know how ridiculous

584
33:57.880 --> 33:59.550
these words sound

585
34:00.880 --> 34:02.270
coming from your mouth?

586
34:05.550 --> 34:07.200
You're lowering yourself

587
34:07.940 --> 34:09.270
and begging to be loved.

588
34:10.900 --> 34:12.780
You're always heartless and caculating.

589
34:12.780 --> 34:15.380
Since when did you become a hopeless romantic?

590
34:28.170 --> 34:28.980
I'm sorry.

591
35:22.860 --> 35:24.010
Second Young Lady Tao,

592
35:24.010 --> 35:25.380
please eat something.

593
35:25.960 --> 35:28.220
You didn't take a single bite last night.

594
35:36.010 --> 35:37.300
[Nanhuai Evening News]

595
35:37.300 --> 35:38.560
Second Young Lady Tao,

596
35:38.860 --> 35:40.090
Eldest Young Lady Tao won't be back

597
35:40.090 --> 35:41.500
for another four or five days.

598
35:41.500 --> 35:43.230
And Master has gone to Tianjin.

599
35:43.260 --> 35:44.320
With you in this state,

600
35:44.320 --> 35:44.670
what am I supposed to do?

601
35:44.670 --> 35:46.810
[Yu Changxuan, Son of Commander-in-Chief Yu, Set to Wed]

602
35:46.830 --> 35:48.560
[With Tao Ziyi, Second Daughter of Tonghui Bank President Tao]

603
35:59.580 --> 36:01.390
[Yu Changxuan, Son of Commander-in-Chief Yu, Set to Wed]

604
36:01.390 --> 36:01.730
Second Young Lady Tao,

605
36:01.730 --> 36:02.930
[With Tao Ziyi, Second Daughter of Tonghui Bank President Tao]

606
36:02.930 --> 36:05.390
please let me know when you feel like eating.

607
36:35.880 --> 36:37.080
Deputy Commander Yu,

608
36:37.780 --> 36:39.920
I have prepared this modest dinner.

609
36:40.230 --> 36:42.530
Thank you for gracing me with your presence.

610
36:42.530 --> 36:44.520
It is truly an honor for me.

611
36:44.760 --> 36:46.760
President Takahashi, you are quite

612
36:47.110 --> 36:48.430
proficient in Chinese.

613
36:48.430 --> 36:50.430
From the Northeast to Tianjin,

614
36:50.630 --> 36:51.880
and then to Nanhuai,

615
36:52.340 --> 36:53.360
I have resided

616
36:53.500 --> 36:55.170
in China for 16 years

617
36:55.650 --> 36:56.590
and developed

618
36:56.900 --> 36:59.420
a deep affection for China.

619
37:01.920 --> 37:03.320
Although it has only been

620
37:03.820 --> 37:05.500
one short year since our chamber of commerce

621
37:05.500 --> 37:07.190
was established in Nanhuai,

622
37:07.610 --> 37:08.590
we've been

623
37:08.590 --> 37:10.170
protected by the Yu Army.

624
37:10.530 --> 37:13.610
Hereby, I express my deepest gratitude.

625
37:13.960 --> 37:15.560
Regardless of nationality,

626
37:16.260 --> 37:17.780
whoever practices legitimate business

627
37:17.780 --> 37:19.380
in legal and reasonable ways

628
37:19.860 --> 37:21.660
should certainly be protected.

629
37:38.730 --> 37:40.390
Your Lordship Fujiwara Sachi,

630
37:40.390 --> 37:41.740
glad to see you here.

631
37:45.870 --> 37:47.070
Deputy Commander Yu,

632
37:47.420 --> 37:49.880
allow me to introduce this gentleman to you.

633
37:55.960 --> 37:58.690
This is His Lordship Fujiwara Sachi.

634
38:00.610 --> 38:03.410
Deputy Commander Yu, I've heard so much about you.

635
38:04.860 --> 38:05.900
Nice to meet you.

636
38:06.310 --> 38:07.710
Mr. Fujiwara, do you also

637
38:07.860 --> 38:09.860
work in the Japanese Chamber of Commerce?

638
38:09.860 --> 38:11.900
Mr. Fujiwara's father

639
38:12.030 --> 38:15.760
was a Meiji-era founding statesman and a hereditary count.

640
38:16.210 --> 38:18.420
After inheriting the title, Mr. Fujiwara

641
38:18.420 --> 38:19.760
traveled to various countries.

642
38:19.760 --> 38:21.230
He is particularly fond of

643
38:21.230 --> 38:23.710
China's beautiful mountains and rivers.

644
38:30.570 --> 38:32.300
After setting foot in Nanhuai,

645
38:33.500 --> 38:35.560
I found it commercially flourishing

646
38:35.790 --> 38:37.360
and well ordered.

647
38:38.050 --> 38:38.650
Today, I finally

648
38:38.650 --> 38:40.860
got to meet the extraordinary Deputy Commander Yu.

649
38:40.860 --> 38:41.990
I hear that your army

650
38:42.210 --> 38:43.980
is invincible wherever its banners go.

651
38:43.980 --> 38:46.300
How very admirable.

652
38:46.400 --> 38:48.060
You flatter me, Mr. Fujiwara.

653
38:48.420 --> 38:49.380
I've only had

654
38:49.380 --> 38:51.100
more opportunities for standing

655
38:51.100 --> 38:52.900
on my forebears' achievements.

656
38:53.710 --> 38:56.360
You're just being modest, Deputy Commander Yu.

657
38:56.360 --> 38:58.000
You are probably aware

658
38:58.500 --> 39:00.760
that as early as seven or eight years ago,

659
39:00.820 --> 39:02.380
the Japanese Chamber of Commerce

660
39:02.380 --> 39:03.960
lent three million yen

661
39:03.980 --> 39:05.030
to Marshal Xu of the Cheng Army

662
39:05.030 --> 39:07.170
through the Bank of Joseon,

663
39:08.000 --> 39:10.130
and he spent it all on guns and cannons.

664
39:10.780 --> 39:12.570
In the entirety of Sujing,

665
39:13.180 --> 39:15.380
you are the person who the Japanese side

666
39:15.880 --> 39:17.140
thinks most highly of.

667
39:17.800 --> 39:18.570
We stand ready

668
39:18.570 --> 39:22.090
to off you various favorable conditions.

669
39:32.960 --> 39:35.030
Deputy Commander Yu, please.

670
40:03.400 --> 40:04.480
It is without doubt

671
40:04.730 --> 40:06.380
